Geo is the root cause. Its deployment has zero available pods for the whole abnormal window, its pod restarted up to 6 times (0 in normal), and it has no spans or pod metrics in the abnormal period. Search's calls to geo all fail, search's failures propagate to frontend's `/hotels`, and the drops in rate, reservation and profile traffic follow from search failing early.

```json
{
  "root_causes": [
    {
      "service": "geo",
      "fault_kind": "pod_unavailable",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "kind": "metric",
          "sql": "SELECT service_name, metric, round(avg(value),2) avg_v, min(value) mn, max(value) mx, count(*) n FROM abnormal_metrics WHERE service_name='geo' AND metric IN ('k8s.deployment.available','k8s.deployment.desired') GROUP BY ALL",
          "claim": "Geo deployment has 0 available pods (desired 1) for the entire abnormal window; normal shows 1 available."
        },
        {
          "kind": "metric",
          "sql": "SELECT attr_k8s_pod_name pod, metric, min(value) mn, max(value) mx, count(*) n FROM abnormal_metrics WHERE metric='k8s.container.restarts' AND attr_k8s_pod_name LIKE 'geo%' GROUP BY ALL",
          "claim": "Geo pod restart counter rose from 3 to 6 during the incident; it was 0 in the normal period."
        },
        {
          "kind": "trace",
          "sql": "SELECT service_name, attr_span_kind, attr_status_code, count(*) n FROM abnormal_traces WHERE span_name='geo.Geo/Nearby' GROUP BY ALL",
          "claim": "Abnormal period: geo.Geo/Nearby has no server spans from geo; search's client calls to it all report Error."
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "propagation": [
    {
      "from": "geo",
      "to": "search",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "kind": "trace",
          "sql": "SELECT service_name, span_name, attr_span_kind, attr_status_code, count(*) n FROM abnormal_traces WHERE service_name='search' AND span_name IN ('geo.Geo/Nearby','search.Search/Nearby') GROUP BY ALL",
          "claim": "Search's geo.Geo/Nearby client spans error in 505 of 506 calls; search's own Nearby server spans error at the same rate."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "from": "search",
      "to": "frontend",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "kind": "trace",
          "sql": "SELECT service_name, span_name, attr_span_kind, attr_status_code, count(*) n FROM abnormal_traces WHERE span_name IN ('HTTP /hotels','search.Search/Nearby') AND attr_span_kind IN ('Server','Client') GROUP BY ALL",
          "claim": "Frontend's HTTP /hotels server spans error in 532 of 533 requests, matching its search.Search/Nearby client errors; other frontend endpoints stay clean."
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
```

